sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Researcher
    participant GO as Go Edge API
    participant SRS as Python SearchRunService
    participant GR as GeneratorRegistry
    participant GEN as CandidateGenerator
    participant EXS as ExperimentService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant W1 as Python Worker 1
    participant WN as Python Worker N
    participant DP as OutboxDispatcher
    participant EVA as Evaluator
    participant RNK as RankingService
    participant ING as Go Internal Event Ingress
    participant HUB as Go WS Hub

    U->>GO: POST /search-runs {generator_id, space, stop, dataset, execution}
    GO->>GO: auth/RBAC + quota + bounded input
    GO->>SRS: create command + principal/correlation_id
    SRS->>DB: atomic admission + INSERT search_run(queued)
    SRS-->>GO: 202 search_run_id
    GO-->>U: 202 search_run_id

    SRS->>GR: resolve(generator_id, exact version)
    GR-->>SRS: Random | DomainGuided | Genetic via same port

    loop bounded loop — check stop before every batch
        SRS->>SRS: max_candidates/duration/non_improving/failure_rate<br/>paused/cancelled/resource quota
        SRS->>GEN: generate(space, seed, history, batch_size)
        GEN-->>SRS: CandidateStrategy[] + generation metadata
        SRS->>DB: INSERT candidates ON CONFLICT(run_id,candidate_hash) DO NOTHING
        alt duplicate
            DB-->>SRS: 0 row, increment dedup count, no backtest
        else new candidate
            SRS->>EXS: create immutable experiment
            EXS->>DB: one transaction: candidate link + experiment snapshot<br/>+ Candle/BBO dataset refs + job + BacktestQueued outbox
        end
        SRS->>ING: signed SearchProgressUpdated<br/>(generated/queued/dedup/ETA)
        ING->>HUB: validate signature + correlation + sequence
    end

    par workers claim independently
        W1->>DB: atomic claim queued/expired lease<br/>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED → token T1
        W1->>W1: same Python StrategyRuntime<br/>+ BBO LONG/SHORT ExecutionSimulator
        W1->>DB: transaction: facts + completed guarded by T1<br/>+ BacktestCompleted outbox
    and
        WN->>DB: claim different job → token TN
        WN->>WN: same runtime and contracts
        WN->>DB: guarded atomic result + outbox
    end

    DP->>EVA: BacktestCompleted (at-least-once)
    EVA->>DB: idempotent consumption + evaluation<br/>+ StrategyEvaluated outbox in one transaction
    DP->>RNK: StrategyEvaluated (aggregate sequence checked)
    RNK->>DB: append leaderboard entry + score policy version
    RNK->>ING: signed LeaderboardUpdated
    ING->>HUB: validate signature + correlation + sequence
    HUB->>U: result/progress without full-page reload

    Note over GR,EVA: Thay generator không đổi ExperimentSnapshot,<br/>StrategyRuntime, ExecutionSimulator, Evaluator hoặc Leaderboard.
